      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.51,
      "end_seconds": 12.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.02,
      "end_seconds": 16.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "well, I've been having being very confused"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.91,
      "end_seconds": 21.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "What's the timeline when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.5,
      "end_seconds": 37.01,
      "duration_seconds": 14.51,
      "text": "Okay so it's been like this since this morning. I didn't want to make a fuss you know. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.6,
      "end_seconds": 40.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I follow. How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.88,
      "end_seconds": 45.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "it feels severe to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.26,
      "end_seconds": 49.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
